{"complete_extracted_copy":false,"coverage":"improved-source","entries":{"fuel-cost-calculator.copy.description":{"context":"fuel-cost-calculator UI copy.description","source_hash":"28b0424515306b4664c435b6ef3c0375e35e4413eda885f057ab6db09788893e","translation":"የጉዞ ነዳጅ እና ወጪ L / 100 ኪሜ, የአሜሪካ MPG ወይም ኢምፔሪያል MPG በመጠቀም. የመመለሻ ጉዞን ጨምሩ እና ወጪውን በተሳፋሪዎች ይከፋፍሉ. ነጻ በድር አሳሽዎ."},"fuel-cost-calculator.copy.examples.0.text":{"context":"fuel-cost-calculator UI copy.examples.0.text","source_hash":"df1f1e80b60d2a0bdcbc598838956251d8a4718f787a1dcff4efd97cb1160777","translation":"100 ኪሜ በ 8 L / 100 ኪሜ 8 ሊትር ይጠቀማል. በ 1.50 ለሊትር, ዋጋው 12.00 ዶላር ነው."},"fuel-cost-calculator.copy.faq.6.question":{"context":"fuel-cost-calculator UI copy.faq.6.question","source_hash":"16509f9ac96d7dbbe8391c51c7a1b04b1e6cff75698e4db9ade0f30ee2f1a6bc","translation":"ይህ የአሁኑን የነዳጅ ዋጋዎች ያመለክታልን?"},"fuel-cost-calculator.copy.intro":{"context":"Shared UI copy.intro","source_hash":"b237cee27f84a7011acd8ab8173e58dca2ef4322298ed9caa18bc7bf99e0be48","translation":"ርቀት, ነዳጅ መጠቀም እና የፖምፕ ዋጋን ያስገቡ. የጉዞ ዋጋን ያሰቡ, የመመለሻ ጉዞ ወይም የተሳፋሪ ድርሻን ጨምሮ."},"fuel-cost-calculator.copy.method.paragraphs.4":{"context":"fuel-cost-calculator UI copy.method.paragraphs.4","source_hash":"95618f6bf7f252e8d45a33a0738cb1321840fba03ade48f81d0799f5e24954b5","translation":"የተሳፋሪ ድርሻ የሙሉ ጉዞውን ዋጋ በሚያጋሩ ሰዎች ተቀባይነት ባለው ሙሉ ቁጥር ላይ ያከፋፍላል። አሽከርካሪው ድርሻውን ሲከፍል አሽከርካሪውን ያካትቱ። የተገለጸው ገንዘብ እና ድርሻዎች በሁለት ቦታዎች ላይ በነፃነት ይዞራሉ፣ ስለዚህም የተዘረጋው ድርሻ በትንሽ ተጨማሪ ከግምቱ ጋር ሊለያይ ይችላል።"},"fuel-cost-calculator.copy.ui.copied":{"context":"fuel-cost-calculator UI copy.ui.copied","source_hash":"a53e263c52533edb4352c9cba5d92004a24af3ea14a03481a95739f840650396","translation":"ወደ ክሊፕቦርዱ ተተኮሰ"},"fuel-cost-calculator.copy.ui.empty":{"context":"fuel-cost-calculator UI copy.ui.empty","source_hash":"72f9b98ac8ee163204fef0a6f69a9f77fe2fc236cbb20f021cbf1b65b74b8326","translation":"ውጤታችሁ እዚህ ይታያል"},"fuel-cost-calculator.copy.ui.trust.0":{"context":"fuel-cost-calculator UI copy.ui.trust.0","sou